# DataShield Project Rules for Cursor / AI Assistants

You are assisting on "DataShield: Django Privacy & Compliance Platform".
Topic: Personal Data Protection & Decree 13/2023 / GDPR Compliance in Django.
Course: Django Cơ Bản (UIT) - Giảng viên: NCS.ThS. Trần Phương Duy.
Team: 
- Le Duy Khanh (Team Lead, Branch: main)
- Nguyen Van Hieu (Member, Branch: nguyen-van-hieu)

MANDATORY RULES & SLIDE STANDARDS (ZERO TOLERANCE):
1. MANDATORY: ALWAYS read `TASKS.md` first to check task assignments and file boundaries.
2. SLIDE TEMPLATE STANDARD (Buổi 2 Slide 18):
   - App templates MUST be in `privacy/templates/privacy/*.html` (namespaced).
   - Project shared templates in `templates/` (404.html, 500.html).
   - In `settings.py`: `TEMPLATES[0]['DIRS'] = [BASE_DIR / 'templates']`, `APP_DIRS = True`.
   - Inheritance: `{% extends "privacy/base.html" %}`, `{% block content %}`.
3. SLIDE STATIC STANDARD (Buổi 2 Slide 29-31):
   - Shared static folder at root: `static/css/style.css`, `static/js/main.js`, `static/images/`.
   - In `settings.py`: `STATIC_URL = 'static/'`, `STATICFILES_DIRS = [BASE_DIR / 'static']`, `STATIC_ROOT = BASE_DIR / 'staticfiles'`.
   - In templates: `{% load static %}`, `{% static 'css/style.css' %}`. NEVER hardcode static paths.
4. SLIDE URL & VIEW STANDARD (Buổi 2 Slide 8-9, 14-15):
   - `app_name = 'privacy'` in `privacy/urls.py`.
   - Use `{% url 'privacy:route_name' %}` in templates; `redirect('privacy:route_name')` in views.
5. SLIDE MODEL & ADMIN STANDARD (Buổi 3 Slide 10-18, 40):
   - Every Model must have `__str__(self)`.
   - ForeignKeys must have `on_delete` and `related_name`.
   - Register models in `admin.py` with `@admin.register` and `list_display`.
6. SECURITY & AUDIT PRESERVATION:
   - NEVER bypass PostgreSQL Row-Level Security (RLS) or `TenantScopedModel`.
   - NEVER modify or delete `AuditEvent` (SHA-256 immutable hash chain).
7. ALWAYS verify with `pytest` before finishing any task.
